It looks like your code adds tasks to the list, but then it stops working because the input box isn't being cleared out. As a result, the next time you try to add a task, the input box is still empty (since it wasn't cleared), and the code detects that the value is an empty string (`''`), so it just doesn't add anything again.

The easiest fix is to simply clear the input field after you add the task.

